understanding ESL English, but this is too jumbled for me to have a clue.

What little I could understand leads me to believe that you think my
opinion is canon, which is not, in fact the case. I don't believe there is
any "official" font for Lojban, nor do I think there ever will be, or that
there needs to be one, either.

My statement is merely that, to myself, personally, the font "Planet Sans"
is very appropriate to Lojban, and that I like how Lojban looks in it
better than I do in other font types.

